--- !u!114 &390735562
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 390735561}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92d663eece5385d4887313326977f042, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Echo::Echo.Presentation.DesignShowcase
  slides:
  - title: ECHO
    subtitle: "PHASE 1 \xB7 CONCEPTION"
    caption: 'A short sci-fi platformer for the browser, built around one idea: the
      hero''s best move costs energy, and energy is scarce.'
    cameraX: 60
    voidColor: {r: 0, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.0627451, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.93, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.85
    music: 1
    overlay: {fileID: 1952316549}
    dim: 0.72
    fromPhase: 1
  - title: EVERY DASH IS A DECISION
    subtitle: THE PITCH
    caption: The dash crosses wide gaps, breaks energy barriers and destroys machines.
      But every dash spends a charge, the suit holds three, and every sector ends
      at a door that only a dash can open. Spend it now, or keep it?
    cameraX: 0
    voidColor: {r: 0, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.0627451, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.93, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.85
    music: 2
    overlay: {fileID: 0}
    dim: 0
    fromPhase: 1
  - title: CORE LOOP
    subtitle: WHAT THE PLAYER DOES
    caption: 'Each sector repeats the loop with something new to spend a charge on:
      barriers, wide pits, drones and turrets, then locks that want charges held
      instead of spent.'
    cameraX: 60
    voidColor: {r: 0, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.0627451, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.93, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.85
    music: 2
    overlay: {fileID: 955937962}
    dim: 0.9
    fromPhase: 1
  - title: THE PREMISE
    subtitle: STORY
    caption: She wakes alone in a cryo pod. The research facility is dark but its
      security still runs. Far below, the reactor that keeps everything alive is
      failing, guarded by the machine built to protect it. Calm the core, and the
      facility can call for help.
    cameraX: 150
    voidColor: {r: 0.011764706, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.043137256, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.7, g: 0.78, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.6
    music: 4
    overlay: {fileID: 0}
    dim: 0.25
    fromPhase: 1
  - title: BROWSER AND PHONE
    subtitle: TARGET PLATFORM
    caption: 'Made in Unity 6 for WebGL and published on GamePix, a web games portal:
      no install, one link, played on desktop and on phones.'
    cameraX: 60
    voidColor: {r: 0, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.0627451, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.93, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.85
    music: 1
    overlay: {fileID: 9456445}
    dim: 0.9
    fromPhase: 1
  - title: WHAT IS IN, WHAT IS OUT
    subtitle: SCOPE
    caption: 'A small game finished well: one mechanic explored deeply, rather than
      many half-built systems.'
    cameraX: 60
    voidColor: {r: 0, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.0627451, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.93, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.85
    music: 1
    overlay: {fileID: 51706319}
    dim: 0.9
    fromPhase: 1
  - title: ARCHITECTURE
    subtitle: "PHASE 2 \xB7 DIAGRAMS"
    caption: Persistent systems live for the whole session; one scene is loaded at
      a time. Gameplay talks to the systems through static events, so levels never
      hold references to the menus, audio or ads.
    cameraX: 60
    voidColor: {r: 0, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.0627451, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.93, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.85
    music: 1
    overlay: {fileID: 46777428}
    dim: 0.92
    fromPhase: 2
  - title: CLASSES
    subtitle: CODE
    caption: 'Three small interfaces carry the rules: anything a dash can hit, anything
      a checkpoint can bring back, and anything a console can switch.'
    cameraX: 60
    voidColor: {r: 0, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.0627451, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.93, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.85
    music: 1
    overlay: {fileID: 1362963944}
    dim: 0.92
    fromPhase: 2
  - title: GAME STATES
    subtitle: STATE MACHINE
    caption: 'GameManager holds one state for the whole game; the HUD, pause menu
      and input read it. There is no game over: a death goes back to the last checkpoint.'
    cameraX: 60
    voidColor: {r: 0, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.0627451, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.93, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.85
    music: 1
    overlay: {fileID: 1399463333}
    dim: 0.92
    fromPhase: 2
  - title: THE GUARDIAN
    subtitle: STATE MACHINE
    caption: The boss loops attack, then an open window. Six hits in three phases;
      each phase opens for less time. A death restarts the current phase, never the
      whole fight.
    cameraX: 150
    voidColor: {r: 0.011764706, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.043137256, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.7, g: 0.78, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.6
    music: 5
    overlay: {fileID: 773191971}
    dim: 0.88
    fromPhase: 2
  - title: SCENE FLOW
    subtitle: SCENES
    caption: Boot picks the first scene for the presentation phase. Each level leads
      to the next only if the phase presents it; otherwise it returns to the menu.
    cameraX: 60
    voidColor: {r: 0, g: 0.015686275, b: 0.0627451, a: 1}
    ambientColor: {r: 0.85, g: 0.93, b: 1, a: 1}
    ambientIntensity: 0.85
    music: 1
    overlay: {fileID: 2118495311}
    dim: 0.92
    fromPhase: 2
  - title: ENERGY ECONOMY
    subtitle: BALANCE
    caption: Every sector gives a little more energy than it needs, so one mistake
      is forgiven but waste is not. The meter never holds more than three charges.
    cameraX: 60
